The getRealmConfig() function generates or loads realm configuration:
When no custom realm JSON is provided, getRealmConfig() generates a realm with:
myrealm (default)myclient with test redirect URIsparsedKeycloakThemesJsonEntry.typesThe onRealmConfigChange() callback is triggered when the Docker container logs keycloakify-logging: REALM_CONFIG_CHANGED, allowing the system to persist realm modifications made via the Keycloak Admin Console.
